  "worked_solution": "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3v & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8 & 5\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3v & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -8 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}v & 5{w}^{2} \\\\ 3v & 2\\end{aligned}|\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -8 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
